            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I mean no offense when I say this, but it seems that the reference implementation is wrong in some way(?), and thus I implore you to reopen this issue.\nI've cross-referenced 2 JS libraries that also implement OKLab/OKLCh conversions and they both output `#12161c`:\n- [Color.js](https://github.com/color-js/color.js#impact) [(Implementation)](https://github.com/color-js/color.js/blob/main/src/spaces/oklab.js) : `new Color.default(\"oklch(20% 0.01368 253.09)\").to(\"srgb\").toString({format: 'hex'})`\n- [culori](https://culorijs.org/) [(Implementation)](https://github.com/Evercoder/culori/blob/main/src/oklab/convertOklabToLrgb.js): `culori.formatHex(culori.rgb(\"oklch(20% 0.01368 253.09)\"))`",
            "created_at": "2025-03-01T23:45:27Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1628#issuecomment-2692472819",
